            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 2,
              "start": 2
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Petitioner Macquarie Infrastructure Corporation owns a subsidiary that operates terminals storing bulk liquid commodities, including No.\u202f6 fuel oil that typically contains about 3% sulfur."
      },
